aurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","review_id":"KhB5Uhw87oxleQgJOG6TQA","date":"2019-02-02T14:16:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9513425230979919,"text_excerpt":"This place was amazing. We were able to be seated here with no way on a Friday night. Our server Guy was fantastic and gave us lots of suggestions about what items we should order. We started off with some wonderful alcoholic drinks that were very strong. We also decided to get the crawfish and alligator fries, which was my favorite dish of the night. I got a poboy that had shrimp and crawfish on it, which I loved cause the seafood was seasoned and cooked so good and tender. Other items I sampled from other people at the table include jambalaya, crab cakes, and fried shrimp, and they all tasted great. Our server even convinced us to get some drinks to go, gotta love New Orleans for that."},{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","review_id":"q6iiSMNu7Q1guiyUiddU_Q","date":"2018-03-06T20:09:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9467236995697021,"text_excerpt":"Our server was exceptionally sweet and swift with our order, even though it was a busy Saturday night (he was also quite attractive, but I swear this review's unbiased). I got the Taste of New Orleans and my friend got crab cakes as an entree, with a side of mashed potatoes. The food was amazing - beans weren't overly cooked, gumbo was hearty, and crawfish etouffee was great. Albeit the crab cakes got to be a bit too heavy and overwhelming, it's anticipated with fried food. Mashed potatoes were okay, nothing memorable. With everything taken into consideration, I still thoroughly enjoyed the meal. One of the better places of all the tourist traps, but it gets to be quite crowded in here. D..."},{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","review_id":"EFBDR9hn6fNW-8_ZiiDlfg","date":"2018-02-20T01:42:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9435354471206665,"text_excerpt":"This place is great, it's more of a late night I'm starving post drink dinner. But that's what it is a great for. We have come back here for the gator bites, and the P.O. boys both times! The shrimp was our favorite, of them all. I had a sugary perfect strawberry margarita, my counterpart had a hurricane. The first one of the trip both times started at the Cookery. The waitstaff remembered us this time and we ordered the bread pudding, which was amazing! Definitely stop on in if you are craving a quick New Orleans style meal!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","photo_id":"lcbE4F1g7ImVvzgpS9CYxQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/lcbE4F1g7ImVvzgpS9CYxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.826664924621582},{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","photo_id":"zWi24S-Q3lksWfSDhmNyCQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zWi24S-Q3lksWfSDhmNyCQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8182631731033325},{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","photo_id":"HnRe9-1a5DcQNcbqnkQHrA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HnRe9-1a5DcQNcbqnkQHrA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8038046360015869},{"business_id":"BbnL_wJLB-EHvFx0dXuAjg","photo_id":"L4SEXbbDHNtnnUkoElbSgQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/L4SE